# Netlify redirects
# Keep serving the app on the .netlify.app subdomain even after a custom
# primary domain is configured: this opts out of Netlify's automatic 301 to
# the primary domain, so the in-app legacy-origin handoff (which exports the
# user's IndexedDB data before hopping to the canonical origin) can run.
https://pivella.netlify.app/* /index.html 200
